{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"On Friday morning I set out — my cousin remained in Brussels — on the diligence to Ghent, saw what could be seen of the Eyck painting there (of which we have the fine pieces in Berlin), and at 2 o’clock boarded the barge to Bruges on the canal (— it is drawn by horses; in the cabin one reads, plays whist, and so on); at 8 o’clock in the evening I arrived. Ghent has 70,000 inhabitants, Bruges 33,000 — in the exterior of the latter, the peculiar Dutch style of building is entirely preserved, which is already blurred and modernized in Ghent, and even more so in Brussels."}}],"created":1795080637,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":151,"prompt_tokens":227,"total_tokens":378,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-3AuBHY7CXaEr6fiyiPB94jGbylXdFfFv","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":227,"prompt_ms":471.619,"prompt_per_token_ms":2.077616740088106,"prompt_per_second":481.3207271123513,"predicted_n":151,"predicted_ms":3633.687,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.22458,"predicted_per_second":41.28038545972727}}